# MC40 Android

- Keep `minSdk 22` and `targetSdk 22`. Permissions are install-time.
- Java 8 language level. No Compose, no coroutines that need newer desugaring than `coreLibraryDesugaring`.
- Enable TLS 1.2 on OkHttp for API 22. Do not bump OkHttp to 5.x.
- Layouts must remain readable at 480×800. Prefer LinearLayout / ScrollView over ConstraintLayout chains.
- Persist HA URL, token, and webhook credentials in SharedPreferences (private mode). Never log the access token.
